~ p1_painting_fight
Leanne: Dammit, David! [#leanne=fight_painting_leanne]
David: What? I didn't even touch it. God, you really do just blame me for everything.
Leanne: I don't blame you, David. Not everything's about you.
David: That's not what you said that night. You know you blame me, stop kidding yourself. But you know, we are both... we were both her parents. And you're just as responsible for this as I am. [#david=fight_painting_david]
Leanne: I already feel terrible enough, I don't need this. Just go away, I'll pick it up.
David: You're gonna cut yourself, let me do it.
Leanne: Stop! Just... just go.
=> END

